{"meta":{"id":"tt6781638","type":"movie","name":"Arrecifes de delfines","description":"Echo es un joven delfín que no termina de decidir si ya es el mismo de madurar y empezar a tomar responsabilidades o si, por el contrario, es mejor seguir con su vida despreocupada y pasarlo bien todo el día. La sociedad de los delfines es complicada, pero el coral en el que viven depende de todos sus habitantes para poder sobrevivir.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dBHT9MT77x35sJqItHuobQeqd0.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ySX3SKhiVjs5phEGrIzEqbmp9YR.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aOysd8Y93lWEpxVlnHcHHqU6FwU.png","genres":["Documental","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2018","released":"2018-03-28T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"6.8","runtime":"77 min","trailers":[{"source":"58xTMQrSLj4","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Natalie Portman"],"director":["Keith Scholey"],"writer":["David H. Fowler"],"links":[{"name":"Natalie Portman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Natalie%20Portman"},{"name":"Keith Scholey","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Keith%20Scholey"},{"name":"David H. Fowler","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=David%20H.%20Fowler"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Natalie Portman","character":"Narrator (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/edPU5HxncLWa1YkgRPNkSd68ONG.jpg","tmdbId":524}],"writers":[{"name":"David H. Fowler","character":"Writer","tmdbId":1563404}]}}}